WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:19.885
"It's a beautiful day," said Dad.

2
00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:24.510
"Let's have a picnic in the park."

3
00:00:24.511 --> 00:00:29.271
"I don't like picnics," said Oliver.

4
00:00:29.272 --> 00:00:32.686
"We can play Frisbee," said Emmy.

5
00:00:32.687 --> 00:00:37.826
"We can look for frogs," said Harry.

6
00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:44.074
"We can eat lunch in the warm sun," said Mom.

7
00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:47.948
"Fine," Oliver said.

8
00:00:47.949 --> 00:00:52.291
"But it won't be fun."

9
00:00:52.292 --> 00:00:58.082
"Let's get ready," said Dad.

10
00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:09.713
Mom put food in the picnic basket.

11
00:01:09.714 --> 00:01:13.662
Emmy and Harry found the Frisbee.

12
00:01:13.663 --> 00:01:27.622
Then everyone drove to the park.

13
00:01:27.623 --> 00:01:31.464
"Let's look for frogs," said Harry.

14
00:01:31.465 --> 00:01:43.885
"First let's play Frisbee!" said Emmy.

15
00:01:43.886 --> 00:01:47.230
Emmy threw the Frisbee to Harry.

16
00:01:47.231 --> 00:01:51.420
Harry threw the Frisbee to Oliver.

17
00:01:51.421 --> 00:01:56.482
Oliver threw the Frisbee to Dad.

18
00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.085
The Frisbee went over Dad's head.

19
00:01:59.086 --> 00:02:03.558
Splash! The Frisbee went in the frog pond!

20
00:02:03.559 --> 00:02:09.164
"Oh no," said Harry.

21
00:02:09.165 --> 00:02:15.139
"We scared away all the frogs!"

22
00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:23.284
"Time for lunch," said Dad.

23
00:02:23.285 --> 00:02:28.385
Dad handed out the sandwiches.

24
00:02:28.386 --> 00:02:33.568
"Mmm," said Mom. "I love—"

25
00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:40.003
Boom!

26
00:02:40.004 --> 00:02:42.836
"What was that?" asked Oliver.

27
00:02:42.837 --> 00:02:47.624
"I think it's thunder," said Emmy.

28
00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:51.931
"It's starting to rain!" said Harry.

29
00:02:51.932 --> 00:02:55.861
Mom packed up all the food.

30
00:02:55.862 --> 00:03:00.027
The family ran back to the car.

31
00:03:00.028 --> 00:03:05.990
Dad handed out the food again.

32
00:03:05.991 --> 00:03:09.736
Oliver watched the rain.

33
00:03:09.737 --> 00:03:15.208
He ate his sandwich.

34
00:03:15.209 --> 00:03:27.794
"What a fun picnic!" he said.
